# UI components (Affect + shadcn)

Prefer **Affect UI** blocks from affectui.com (`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://www.affectui.com/r/<slug>.json`) for product patterns (profile menu, reactions, loaders, clean inputs).

For primitives missing from Affect (sidebar, dialog, alert-dialog, scroll-area, sheet), use **`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name>`** and theme tokens from `app/globals.css` — not `prompt()` / `confirm()`.

# Affect UI form controls

Install with shadcn registry URLs from affectui.com when missing.

- **Single-line inputs**: `TextField` from `@/components/ui/text-field-clean` — not raw `<input>` or default shadcn Input.
- **Multi-line inputs**: `TextArea` from `@/components/ui/text-area-clean` — not raw `<textarea>`.
- **Cursor / agent “working” state**: `ThinkingLoader` from `@/components/ui/thinking-loader-clean` (e.g. chat while awaiting `/api/cursor-chat`).

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://www.affectui.com/r/text-field-clean.json
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://www.affectui.com/r/text-area-clean.json
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://www.affectui.com/r/thinking-loader-clean.json
```
